{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["The Titan's Bride","Kouichi Mizuki is summoned to a world of Giant Titans by ancient magic. Arriving in the land of Tildant, the Prince, Caius, appears in front of Kouichi and says, \"Destiny has brought you to me. You are my fated bride!\" Kouichi agrees to stay for a month in order to get back home. However, the Prince is in a bind. He can only marry someone from another world, or else Tildant will befall a terrible fate! If Kouichi doesn't stay permanently, will the prophecy ever be fulfilled?\n\n\n\n(Source: Ascendant Animation)\n\n\n\nNote: The complete edition with explicit scenes was distributed web via Comic Festa Anime Zone. The censored version was broadcasted on Tokyo MX."],"ja":["巨人族の花嫁",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-41466","ids":{"shikimori":41466,"mal":41466,"anilist":116648,"kodik":"serial-27472"},"kodikIds":["serial-28150","serial-27472"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-28150":"2020-11-12T17:45:46Z","serial-27472":"2020-08-31T06:20:07Z"},"title":"Невеста титана","originalTitle":"Kyojin-zoku no Hanayome","alt":"Kyojinzoku no Hanayome / The Titan's Bride The Titan's Bride 巨人族の花嫁","description":"Высокий мускулистый Коити выгодно отличался от сверстников своей богатырской статью. Однако ему пришлось почувствовать себя настоящим гномом, когда одним прекрасным вечером его закинуло в другой мир и он очутился среди великанов. Причём не где-нибудь, а сразу в королевском дворце перед лицом коронованного принца Гая Лао Бистэйла , который тотчас предложил ему руку и сердце!","year":2020,"type":"ONA","genres":["Фэнтези","яой","исэкай"],"rating":5.53,"popularity":7487,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx116648-Pfp085LtQ7jp.jpg","width":460,"height":649},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/b55d3f329b998854cb8821a637924f7bfc7894fe.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,